                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.428/1386: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Chargé in Canada</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Riggs</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-05-08T15:00:00-04:00">May 8, 1930—3
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>55. Your 70, May 7, 2 p.m. Proposed change is accepted by this Government.</p>
                <p>Please inform Department by telegram immediately after signature of date and hour
                    of signature, in order that statement may be given to the press.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
